@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

# ACCESS REQUESTS

### Listar tudo
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests

### Paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?page=1&perPage=5

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?page=2&perPage=10

### Sem paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?paginate=false

# FILTROS

### Status exato
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[overallStatus]=pending

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[overallStatus][eq]=pending

### Por userId
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[userId]=1

### Lista de status
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[overallStatus][in]=pending,approved

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[overallStatus][notIn]=rejected

### Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[createdAt][gte]=2024-01-01

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[createdAt][between]=2024-01-01,2024-12-31

### Soft delete
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[deletedAt][isNull]=true

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[deletedAt][isNull]=false

### Combinado
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[overallStatus]=pending&filter[deletedAt][isNull]=true

# ORDENAÇÃO

### Por data
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?sort=createdAt

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?sort=-createdAt

### Por status + data
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?sort=overallStatus,-createdAt

### Por campo de relacionamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=user&sort=user.firstName

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=user&sort=-user.firstName

# CAMPOS

### Seleção de campos
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?fields=id,userId,overallStatus

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?fields=id,overallStatus,createdAt,updatedAt

# INCLUDES

### Usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=user

### Itens
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=items

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=items&fields=items

### Itens com relacionamentos aninhados
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=items.company

GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=items,items.company,items.module

### Tudo
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes=user,items,items.company,items.module

# SEARCH

### Includes completos para inspecionar o resultado do search
@searchIncludes = user,items,items.company,items.module

#       'user.firstName',
#       'user.document',
#       'items.company.name',
#       'items.company.cnpj'


### Busca no usuario admin fixo
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=Admin

### Busca por documento do admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=00000000000

### Busca aninhada em empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=Magazine

### Busca aninhada por CNPJ da empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=14.380.200/0001-21

### Busca aninhada em modulo
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=Mercury

### Busca combinando fields restritos com search
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&fields=id,userId,overallStatus,createdAt&search=Admin

### Search vazio deve ser noop
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=

### Search com wildcard no input deve ser tratado como texto literal
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=%25admin%25

# COMBINAÇÕES

### Pending + includes + ordenação + página
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[overallStatus]=pending&includes=user,items&sort=-createdAt&page=1&perPage=5

### Ativos + campos mínimos + ordenação
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[deletedAt][isNull]=true&fields=id,userId,overallStatus,createdAt&sort=userId

### Data + includes completo + campos + página
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[createdAt][gte]=2024-01-01&includes=user,items,items.company,items.module&fields=id,userId,overallStatus,createdAt&sort=-createdAt&page=1&perPage=20

### Ativos + status in + user + userId agrupado
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[deletedAt][isNull]=true&filter[overallStatus][in]=pending,approved&includes=user&sort=userId,-createdAt&page=1&perPage=10

### Ativos + tudo + ordem por nome do usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[deletedAt][isNull]=true&includes=user,items,items.company,items.module&sort=user.firstName,overallStatus&paginate=false

### Search em relacionamento + filtro + ordenacao + pagina
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?filter[deletedAt][isNull]=true&includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=Mercury&sort=-createdAt&page=1&perPage=10

### Search com join reutilizado por includes completo
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-requests?includes={{searchIncludes}}&search=Magazine&sort=user.firstName&page=1&perPage=10
